lisa-design:
- Caller pins compliance-framework/workflows to full SHA a94553bdc479fac47fbea7febbf57dcb615dbc87 (head of workflows#5) for the W1-S1 trial, not @v1; notify-failure gets the same SHA as workflows-ref because a reusable workflow cannot see its own ref.
- pull_request listens for opened/edited/synchronize/reopened so ci-common's pr-title job re-checks edited titles (README guidance).
- Top-level permissions: {}; each job grants only what the README documents (ci: actions/contents/pull-requests read + security-events write; notify: actions/contents read).
- No repo-local .golangci.yml added: the shared base config is used deliberately. v1 protocol and agent v0.8.1 pin are intentional for this mock and must not change.
